{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Why can a hotter pan make a drop of water last longer?",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 3.159583,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.1",
      "samples": 75830,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-2",
      "transcript": "On a hot metal surface, water can touch the metal and boil away quickly.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 3.5,
      "duration": 4.233375,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.2",
      "samples": 101601,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Heat it far enough, and something changes.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 8,
      "duration": 2.236875,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.3",
      "samples": 53685,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-4",
      "transcript": "The bottom of the drop turns to vapor almost instantly.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 10.5,
      "duration": 3.149333,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.4",
      "samples": 75584,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-5",
      "transcript": "That vapor forms a cushion, lifting the rest of the water off the metal.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 13.9,
      "duration": 3.833917,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.5",
      "samples": 92014,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Now heat must cross a poorly conducting gas layer.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 18.1,
      "duration": 2.927208,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.6",
      "samples": 70253,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The hotter surface has created a barrier to its own heat.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 21.266666666666666,
      "duration": 3.110708,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.7",
      "samples": 74657,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-8",
      "transcript": "This is the Leidenfrost effect.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 24.766666666666666,
      "duration": 1.975292,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.8",
      "samples": 47407,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-9",
      "transcript": "It doesn’t mean hotter always makes water last longer.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 27,
      "duration": 2.849417,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.9",
      "samples": 68386,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-10",
      "transcript": "The transition depends on the surface and the drop.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 30.1,
      "duration": 3.011125,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.10",
      "samples": 72267,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-11",
      "transcript": "Above it, more heat can speed evaporation again.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 33.36666666666667,
      "duration": 2.858167,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.11",
      "samples": 68596,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "heat-cue-12",
      "transcript": "The surprise is that a hotter surface can give water less direct contact with the heat.",
      "file": "audio/heat-v4/narration/cue-12.wav",
      "start": 36.46666666666667,
      "duration": 4.927,
      "beatIndex": 11,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "heat-barrier.asset.vapor-cushion.script.12",
      "samples": 118248,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
